14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 max-w-3xl","children":["$undefined",["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-content prose prose-blue max-w-none","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Overtrading feels productive, but it often leads to losses.</p>\n<p>If you want the psychological root causes, read <a href=\"/blog/psychology-of-crypto-investing\">The Psychology of Crypto Investing</a>.</p>\n<h2>Why overtrading happens</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>excitement</li>\n<li>fear of missing out</li>\n<li>lack of structure</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>How to avoid overtrading</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>set clear strategies</li>\n<li>invest long-term</li>\n<li>reduce decision frequency</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Final thoughts</h2>\n<p>Fewer decisions often lead to better results.</p>\n<p>To compare approaches, see <a href=\"/blog/crypto-investing-vs-crypto-trading\">Crypto Investing vs Crypto Trading</a>.</p>\n<p>Invest with discipline, not impulse.\n<a href=\"/plans\">Explore WolvCapital's structured plans.</a></p>\n<p>Learn more about WolvCapital on the homepage.\n<a href=\"/\">Visit WolvCapital.</a></p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-12 border-t border-gray-200 pt-8","children":[["$","$L4",null,{}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-disclaimer mt-4","aria-label":"Risk disclaimer","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-disclaimer__card rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Risk disclosure: Digital assets and cryptocurrency-related products can be volatile. You may lose some or all of your invested capital. Consider your circumstances and only invest what you can afford to lose."}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/blog","className":"font-semibold text-[#0b2f6b] hover:text-[#2563eb] transition","children":"← Back to all articles"}]}]]}]]}]}]]}],["$L5"],"$L6"]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
